 In a previous article, v056ped5@ubvmsb.cc.buffalo.edu (BRIAN M. MCNAMARA) writes:
>Oh yeah...#untrap is an available command, but I have never seen a trap
>that could be disarmed. What gives?

#untrap is used for disarming traps in chests when you open them, from my
experience.  To use it, stand on the chest, hit #untrap, and use '.' for the
direction when asked.  Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn't.  Do this before
you try to open the chest or unlock it.  If the chest is trapped, you will
sometimes find it.  If you find it, you will usually be able to remove the trap.
Sometimes it goes off anyway, kind of like working on a bomb squad.

